  "details": "I was playing the Suika game and streaming some music over VRCDN.\n\nThen suddenly my Internet connection became very unstable.\n\nMy stream stopped, and while I was trying to figure out what was wrong with it, I got the \"connection to VRChat timed out\" message.\n\nAfter a couple retries a managed to get back into the world, but the game was not functioning - all players and their games were frozen, their avatars weren't loading, and as I noticed later, the persistence data hadn't loaded either (I had only 1 Melbux instead of 425 billion).\n\nAfter half a minute I got another \"connection timeout\" message and rejoined the world again. This time it was working, but very sluggish, and my persistence data didn't restore - it was gone at this point.\n\nHere's a recording of all of this happening:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/rL3wOgvS0rQ\n\nAlso attaching the log file and two screenshots: the first shows that I had 425B Melbux before the disconnection, and second shows me having only 1 after rejoining.",
